### Save Image 1
POST http://localhost:5202/api/storagetest/save/5
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DentalRayBoundary

--DentalRayBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="2.jpeg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< D:\2.jpeg
--DentalRayBoundary--

